OL,3,GNEWSAColder and darker school days
OL,4,A'tricky' for pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeading back to school as the days get
OL,7,Fcolder and darker can be challenging
OL,8,Ffor pupils, a child psychologist has
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FGemma Daniel, who lives and works in
OL,12,FJersey, said the change in the weather
OL,13,Fand the clocks going back brought
OL,14,Fdifficulties for children as they
OL,15,Freturned to their classrooms after the
OL,16,FOctober half term.
OL,18,FShe said the change in routine can also
OL,19,Fbe hard for parents to handle as they
OL,20,Fbalance family life, childcare and
OL,21,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
